# Java Web Application Deployment Using Azure DevOps CI/CD, Docker & AKS

## 1. Project Overview

This project demonstrates how to automate the build, containerization, and deployment of a Java Spring Boot web application using Azure DevOps CI/CD.

The application source code is stored in GitHub. Azure DevOps automatically builds the Java application, creates a Docker image, pushes it to Azure Container Registry (ACR), and deploys it to Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS).

### Technologies Used

- Java 17
- Spring Boot
- Maven
- Git & GitHub
- Azure DevOps
- Docker
- Azure Container Registry (ACR)
- Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)
- Kubernetes YAML

