## 7. Step 4: Create Azure DevOps Pipeline

**File: azure-pipelines.yml**

```
trigger:
  - main

pool:
  vmImage: ubuntu-latest

variables:
  imageName: java-web-app
  acrName: myregistry.azurecr.io

stages:

# ================= CI STAGE =================

- stage: Build
  displayName: Build Java Application

  jobs:
  - job: BuildJob

    steps:

    # Build Java Application
    - task: Maven@4
      displayName: Build Java JAR
      inputs:
        mavenPomFile: pom.xml
        goals: clean package
        javaHomeOption: JDKVersion
        jdkVersionOption: '1.17'

    # Build and Push Docker Image
    - task: Docker@2
      displayName: Build and Push Docker Image
      inputs:
        command: buildAndPush
        repository: $(imageName)
        dockerfile: Dockerfile
        containerRegistry: my-acr-connection
        tags: |
          $(Build.BuildId)

# ================= CD STAGE =================

- stage: Deploy
  displayName: Deploy to AKS

  dependsOn: Build

  jobs:
  - job: DeployJob

    steps:

    # Deploy Application to Kubernetes
    - task: KubernetesManifest@1
      displayName: Deploy Java Application
      inputs:
        action: deploy
        kubernetesServiceConnection: my-aks-connection
        namespace: default
        manifests: |
          k8s/deployment.yml
        containers: |
          $(acrName)/$(imageName):$(Build.BuildId)
```

**Explanation:**

| Pipeline instruction  | Purpose                                             |
| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| trigger               | Starts pipeline when code is pushed to main.        |
| pool                  | Selects the Ubuntu build agent.                     |
| Maven\@4              | Builds Java application and generates JAR.          |
| Docker\@2             | Builds and pushes Docker image.                     |
| Build.BuildId         | Provides a unique image tag for the pipeline run.   |
| KubernetesManifest\@1 | Applies Kubernetes manifests and updates the image. |
| dependsOn             | Runs deployment only after successful build stage.  |

