## 10. Important Docker Commands

### Build Docker Image

```
docker build -t java-web-app:v1 .
```

### Login to Azure Container Registry

```
az acr login --name myregistry
```

### Tag Docker Image

```
docker tag java-web-app:v1 myregistry.azurecr.io/java-web-app:v1
```

### Push Docker Image

```
docker push myregistry.azurecr.io/java-web-app:v1
```

### Check Kubernetes Pods

```
kubectl get pods
```

### Check Kubernetes Deployment

```
kubectl get deployments
```

### Check Application Service

```
kubectl get services
```

