## 11. Required Azure DevOps Configurations

Before running the pipeline, configure:

| Configuration          | Purpose                                    |
| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| GitHub connection      | Connect GitHub repository to Azure DevOps. |
| ACR Service Connection | Authenticate Docker tasks with ACR.        |
| AKS Service Connection | Allow pipeline to communicate with AKS.    |
| ACR Pull Permission    | Allow AKS to download Docker images.       |
| Pipeline YAML          | Configure automated CI/CD stages.          |

Replace the following placeholders with your actual resource details:

- `myregistry.azurecr.io` – Your ACR login server.
- `my-acr-connection` – Your Azure Container Registry service connection.
- `my-aks-connection` – Your AKS service connection.

