## 13. Final Pipeline Flow

### CI – Continuous Integration

**GitHub → Maven Build → JAR → Docker Build → Docker Image → ACR**

### CD – Continuous Delivery / Deployment

**ACR → Azure DevOps → AKS → Kubernetes Deployment → Pods → Running Application**

### Complete Flow

**GitHub → Azure DevOps → Maven → Docker → ACR → AKS → Pods → Web Application**

