## 14. Project Summary

Implemented an automated CI/CD pipeline using Azure DevOps to build and containerize a Java Spring Boot web application. Integrated GitHub for source code management, Maven for application builds, Docker for containerization, Azure Container Registry for image storage, and Azure Kubernetes Service for application deployment.

The pipeline automates application builds, Docker image publishing, and Kubernetes deployment whenever code changes are pushed to the main branch.

